---
// A landing page's features, three to a row where the page is wide. Each
// card takes three of the grid's rows, so a row's titles, rules, text and
// links line up however long any of them runs.
---

<div class="features not-content hypha:my-12 hypha:grid hypha:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)] hypha:gap-x-4 hypha:gap-y-4 hypha:md:grid-cols-2 hypha:lg:grid-cols-3"><slot /></div>
